Not in a retirement account you can't

7
00:00:11,902 --> 00:00:12,254
touch.

8
00:00:12,434 --> 00:00:13,363
Not in crypto.

9
00:00:13,543 --> 00:00:15,268
Just cash, ready,

10
00:00:15,268 --> 00:00:15,876
yours.

11
