44
00:01:13,608 --> 00:01:16,229
So we'll go through fifteen real changes,

45
00:01:16,229 --> 00:01:16,933
one by one,

46
00:01:16,933 --> 00:01:18,787
with the numbers behind them.

47
00:01:18,967 --> 00:01:20,703
Then I'll show you exactly where to

48
